WEBVTT

00:23:28.445 --> 00:23:31.584
And I just don't think it's going to work.

00:23:32.608 --> 00:23:35.004
There's a woman in Atlanta, Debbie Dooley,

00:23:35.028 --> 00:23:37.109
who's the Chairman
of the Atlanta Tea Party.

00:23:37.133 --> 00:23:39.310
They enlisted her
in this effort to put a tax

00:23:39.334 --> 00:23:41.457
on solar panels and regulations.

00:23:41.481 --> 00:23:43.600
And she had just put
solar panels on her roof

00:23:43.624 --> 00:23:45.490
and she didn't understand the request.

00:23:45.514 --> 00:23:47.279
(Laughter)

00:23:47.303 --> 00:23:50.781
And so she went and formed
an alliance with the Sierra Club

00:23:50.805 --> 00:23:54.858
and they formed a new organization
called the Green Tea Party.

00:23:54.882 --> 00:23:55.884
(Laughter)

00:23:55.908 --> 00:23:56.909
(Applause)

00:23:56.933 --> 00:23:58.421
And they defeated the proposal.

00:23:58.445 --> 00:24:01.671
So, finally, the answer
to your question is,